{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:58 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:52 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:52 2026-10-29 HKT</p><img alt=\"業主上門揭單位內大量動物死亡，警方列作虐待動物案調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a191cd6a46b192bcbe770f40b4d98e7/2026-10/page_264.jpg\"/><p>今日（29日）早上10時39分，觀塘成業街19至21號成業工業大廈一單位因為欠租，女業主於是上門收回單位，未料其間她驚見單位內有大量動物屍體，連忙報警求助。警員趕到並通知愛護動物協會派員到場，調查後發現單位內有20隻龜、6條魚和2隻蜥蜴死亡，遂將案件列作殘酷對待動物，正追查單位租客的下落。</p><img alt=\"女業主上門收回單位時揭發案件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d5b7556ada1bd5b50cb7da0875a773c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_55_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/724600aec90028f8622bb77125a48cdb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_55.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位內設有多個魚缸，有大量龜隻、魚和蜥蜴死亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/173f2ea179719b4bef56f507e7af0c5c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_48.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f223aee9da0b95baae0add1b14bfbd73/2026-10/222.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d00d4fced6867ca108b20611f55e7bcb/2026-10/333.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在單位調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a66fa8d006f118cdbffd4674fe162b2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"愛協人員到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1bc4bd1df61726f9a877df3912ee6d2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_45.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封鎖涉事單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1a0e553417aa6e06e8fad15accb1c58/2026-10/1_1_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事單位外設有閉露電視鏡頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35c233610b059e0c8d79a1ec3ec9a3cd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_53_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/802539efb01e351058d1dc026d1c82ea/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_54_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/245b33916746ee5d3c3ab94155d2bd6f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_53.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef86dbf22b9b5d9dfb5497383fa94bf1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/962f6c0bab247a6208fb06b7ed39d752/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_51.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是成業工廈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a1cae0995c9b37a2571b16661fe1f54/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_12_44_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2954b55de62f5cfdfd39c341799cd5ea/2026-10/2_29.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:12.948097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:58:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:54.256460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:35.590837+00:00","content_hash":"d972ee049011458687160cc2aa7f9c9a22a60cb95ad7ce95c1199014f833e84c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}